ipt crackles. i lift both pencils. the metal smell is gone. i put the pencils back. the receipt stays folded. i do not label the tin.", "blue tin. two pencils. the receipt. i will put the blue tin back. the blue tin is clean. i will check the blue tin again. i keep it tidy."]]

